{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Nebo</b> — the name of a person, and likewise: Magbish, and Elam, and Harim. It is possible that it is Nebo Baal Meon, and likewise Lod and Hadid and Ono is missing a vav, and likewise it is, \"and Hadid\" — from these three came the sons of Jericho; it is the known one."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {0 "The comment is terse and elliptical throughout; the final clause ׳הוא הידוע׳ is rendered literally, though its referent is ambiguous."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:38.035357521Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}